The edition (the default): since your last visit, earlier this week and fading, with the Later shelf's count

Usage: mxr reading edition [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --peek               Look without counting it as a visit, so "since you were last here" doesn't move on
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
